Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:28:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 383/443] [ae-patch] Fix the voice stall review findings: long
 speech, restart cap, fresh start window (0383)

Browser takes run with interimResults off, so a speechstart with no end event now
gets a 20 s hung limit instead of 6 s (the 3.5 s rule still applies after any end
event), and the idle recycle waits while speech is open. Event-detector restarts
are capped at 4 a minute (log: mic stall restart capped, no deaf report) until the
next result or new take. silentRestart restarts the no-audiostart window so a slow
audiostart after any silent restart is not reported deaf.
